      "name": "Keto Sausage & Brussel Sheet Pan Meal [Only 4 Ingredients]",
      "description": "This sausage brussel sprout sheet pan can not be any easier to make! Simply chop up the Brussels sprouts, toss them in olive oil and salt. Chop up the kielbasa, put the Brussels sprouts and kielbasa in the oven and your keto dinner will be ready in 20 minutes!\n\nThis is a great way to get your protein and vegetables in for a weeknight dinner! Remember to always look for the cleanest processed meats as you can. Typically kielbasa will not have too much filler in it, but make sure you always check the nutrition label and carb counts!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n12 ounce brussels sprouts\n2 tablespoon olive oil\n1 teaspoon sea salt\n12 ounce kielbasa\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 4 serving of Keto Sausage and Brussel Sprout Sheet Pan Meal. Each serving comes out to be 334 calories, 26.9g fat, 6.1g net carbs, and 14.4g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
